# COMPONENT

## SmWorkflow

### DESCRIPTION

Run software-development workflows with Workflow-owned state, deterministic calculations and managed effects. An AI participant receives only the issued semantic task and returns its declared result; it does not select transitions, run external commands or access storage. AI invocation and client round-trip reduction are explicit goals, not measured claims for this development runtime. The normal factory composes GoalPhase, SplitPhase and RepositorySync Operations with shared Subsystem storage and managed effects. Phase2 executable specifications call these Operations directly; CLI/skill wiring belongs to Phase6, and integrated acceptance remains incomplete. Consult the reference manual and configured host before calling an operation; declarations alone do not install handlers or grant consent.

### PACKAGE

org.simplemodeling.textus.smworkflow

### COMPONENTLET

#### public-goal-phase-workflow

#### goal-phase-workflow-admin

#### public-split-phase-workflow

#### split-phase-workflow-admin

#### public-repository-sync-workflow

#### repository-sync-workflow-admin

